Yes, it is a feature, you can generate an unlimited number of ghosts
that way. THe ghosts themselves are usually more of an annoyance than a
threat- you can outrun them easily enough, as long as they don't block
your way. However being frozen in fear every time a ghost turns up can
be nasty, especially seeing as there's no defence against that.

Without a priest to donate to, you should abandoned the protection run-
which means grabbing as much bones gear as you can carry without
burdening yourself and retreating back to an easier level, there to
continue the game from the beginning.



